        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Organizations: Ellesmere Port Town F.C., Ford Motors F.C., West Cheshire Association Football League\n- Places: Cheshire, Dunkirk Lane\n- Topics: English football leagues, sponsorship, competition levels\n\nFacts:\n- The West Cheshire Association Football League is an English football league in the county of Cheshire.\n- Ford Motors F.C. reached the fourth round of the FA Vase in 1985.\n- Ellesmere Port Town F.C. are currently members of the West Cheshire League Division Two and play at Dunkirk Lane.\n- The West Cheshire Association Football League is commonly known as the West Cheshire League.\n- Ford Motors F.C. compete in the West Cheshire Association Football League.\n- Carlsberg is the current principal sponsor of the West Cheshire Association Football League and also sponsors the South West Peninsula League.",
